<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cstat (200)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cstat
</pre>
<p>Lists the clans of Valhalla: for each, its name, its clan master, and how 
many members it has. Players see the clans with <a cmd='#'>clist</a>, without the 
number of members.
</p><p>The clan ids that <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Cdelete</a> needs aren't shown here; they are the 
first line of each clan's entry in clanlist.data (in the clan zone's 
strings directory, lib/clan/strings by default). It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Cdelete</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>
</pre>




</div>